#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# M phase, Nb-Ni-Al  (nominal Nb48Ni39Al13)
# Source: C. B. Shoemaker & D. P. Shoemaker, Acta Cryst. (1967) 23, 231-238
#         doi:10.1107/S0365110X6700252X
# Coordinates and B from Table 2 of the paper (single-crystal X-ray, R = 0.115).
#
# Notes:
#  * Space group as published: Pnam (non-standard setting of Pnma, No. 62),
#    mirror planes perpendicular to c at z = 1/4, 3/4.
#  * Sites I-VI (C.N.14/15/16) are Nb.
#  * C.N.12 sites (VII-XI) are a Ni/Al mixture. The paper gives f0 consistent
#    with ~0.75 Ni + 0.25 Al; that ratio is used here for all C.N.12 sites.
#    Site VII scatters more strongly (Ni-rich or some Nb), see the paper.
#  * Resulting cell content: Nb24 Ni21 Al7 (52 atoms), cf. nominal Nb25Ni20.3Al6.8.
#  * Uiso = B / (8 pi^2).
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
